# Prettier 3 also reads .gitignore, so node_modules/ is already excluded there.
# This file only lists tracked files that must stay out of the formatter.

# Bun lockfile — machine-generated
bun.lock

# Markdown is deliberately unformatted, as it is fleet-wide (INFRA-158, and
# progress's docs/decisions/prettier-adoption.md): Prettier pipe-pads tables so
# any cell edit re-pads the whole table — the giant whitespace diffs this setup
# exists to prevent — and rewrites *italic* as _italic_ across hand-written docs.
*.md

# The Claude PR review kit is copied byte for byte from bkennedy/infrastructure
# (scripts/forgejo-review-sync.mjs), and its nightly drift check compares these
# files verbatim. Formatting them here would make every copy drift from
# canonical; change them in infrastructure and re-sync instead. Listed ahead of
# the kit's arrival so the first `bun run format` after a sync cannot drift them.
scripts/forgejo-review.mjs
.forgejo/workflows/claude-review.yml
